<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<AUTOSAR xmlns="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0 AUTOSAR_00046.xsd">
  <ADMIN-DATA>
    <DOC-REVISIONS>
      <DOC-REVISION>
        <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
        <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
      </DOC-REVISION>
    </DOC-REVISIONS>
  </ADMIN-DATA>
  <AR-PACKAGES>
    <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:AUTOSAR">
      <SHORT-NAME>AUTOSAR</SHORT-NAME>
      <AR-PACKAGES>
        <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:ECUCDEFS">
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDefs</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-MODULE-DEF UUID="ECUC:2cef58ce-79fe-4a40-935b-ee76b6a60605">
              <SHORT-NAME>EcuM</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of the EcuM (ECU State Manager) module.</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EcuM配置项代表电子控制单元管理模块（ECU Manager），它负责ECU的启动、关机逻辑以及与底层MCU驱动的交互，确保系统的正确初始化和电源管理。</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置EcuM时，需要确保与具体的硬件平台和MCU驱动兼容；EcuM的配置参数必须符合AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中定义的模块和参数规范；在多ECU系统中，还需要考虑ECU间的通信和同步机制。</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
                <DOC-REVISIONS>
                  <DOC-REVISION>
                    <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
                    <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
                  </DOC-REVISION>
                </DOC-REVISIONS>
              </ADMIN-DATA>
              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuM_00225</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>
              <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
              </SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
              <CONTAINERS>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:16fb469f-1f19-45e7-b4e5-555ae0f14089">
                  <SHORT-NAME>EcuMConfiguration</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of the ECU State Manager.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EcuMConfiguration 是用于定义电子控制单元管理（EcuM）模块的配置参数，包括启动配置、休眠模式、唤醒源等，以支持ECU的启动、管理和休眠策略。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置EcuMConfiguration时，需要确保唤醒源与硬件能力相匹配；正确配置休眠模式以优化能耗；在多ECU系统中，需考虑ECU间的通信和同步。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuM_00103</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:8e610dbe-ea33-4a18-bca8-c4d70a9da2f1">
                      <SHORT-NAME>EcuMCommonConfiguration</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the common configuration (parameters) of the ECU State Manager.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EcuMCommonConfiguration 是用于定义ECU管理模块中所有基本配置的参数，这些配置涵盖了系统启动、电源管理和诊断等方面。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保所有的配置参数符合ECU的硬件和软件需求；在多核或多ECU系统中，需要特别注意配置的一致性和兼容性；配置参数应当通过专业的配置工具进行设置和验证，以防止错误配置导致系统不稳定。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuM_00181</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0bae5ee1-7bcc-4635-a400-d245750296dd">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EcuMConfigConsistencyHash</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">In the pre-compile and link-time configuration phase a hash value is generated across all pre-compile and link-time parameters of all BSW modules.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EcuMConfigConsistencyHash 是一个用于验证ECU配置一致性的哈希值，确保在软件开发和部署过程中，ECU的配置数据保持一致。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在软件开发的不同阶段，如编译、链接和加载到ECU上时，都需要验证EcuMConfigConsistencyHash以确保配置的一致性；如果在这些阶段中发现哈希值不匹配，可能意味着配置数据已被更改，需要重新生成和验证；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于生成和比较该哈希值的具体算法和方法有明确规定，需要遵循这些规定以确保兼容性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">In the post-build phase a hash value is generated across all pre-compile and link-time parameters, except for parameters located in EcucParamConfContainerDef instances or subContainers which have been introduced at post-build configuration time.

                                                This hash value is compared against each other and allows checking the consistency of the entire configuration.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuM_00102</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>18446744073709551615</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:65c6e769-6d64-4d96-8675-7983ccee0258">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EcuMDefaultAppMode</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">The default application mode loaded when the ECU comes out of reset.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EcuMDefaultAppMode配置项用于定义系统启动后的默认应用模式，这决定了系统在启动后将进入哪种操作模式。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的设置必须与系统设计的应用模式一致，以确保系统能按预期工作；在多应用系统中，正确的默认应用模式选择对系统行为有重要影响；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中是必需的，缺失可能导致系统启动异常。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuM_00104</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsAppMode</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:c2dcaae0-bc92-410f-bdb9-adf1d91ecffc">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EcuMOSResource</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter is a reference to a OS resource which is used to bring the ECU into sleep mode.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EcuMOSResource配置项用于定义ECU管理模块（EcuM）所需的操作系统资源，如任务、事件、资源等，以确保EcuM模块能够正确管理ECU的启动、关闭和模式切换。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保为EcuM模块配置的操作系统资源满足其实时性和优先级要求；操作系统资源的配置应遵循AUTOSAR OS模块的规范；不正确的资源配置可能导致系统启动或模式切换时的性能问题。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">In case of multi core each core shall have an own OsResource.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuM_00183</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsResource</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:aebde982-c84c-47f2-ac81-1989258cbaef">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EcuMDefaultShutdownTarget</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container describes the default shutdown target to be selected by EcuM. The actual shutdown target may be overridden by the EcuM_SelectShutdownTarget service.</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuM_00105</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ccac5543-c698-41bb-869a-fa1a6acbf26f">
                              <SHORT-NAME>EcuMDefaultShutdownTarget</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter describes the state part of the default shutdown target selected when the ECU comes out of reset. If EcuMShutdownTargetSleep is selected, the parameter EcuMDefaultSleepModeRef selects the specific sleep mode.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EcuMDefaultShutdownTarget配置项定义了ECU管理器（EcuM）在没有接收到任何明确的关机目标时应采取的默认关机行为，例如选择默认的睡眠模式或是重启。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置EcuMDefaultShutdownTarget时，需要确保所选的默认关机目标与系统的功耗和安全要求相符；此配置项对系统的启动和关机策略有直接影响，因此需要仔细规划；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应确保该配置项的属性与标准定义的参数一致，以免出现不兼容的情况。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuM_00107</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:f36aaca6-a0cc-925d-58a1-4862fed97f58">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>EcuMShutdownTargetOff</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:c45941d2-2cca-89f2-5062-070ec82de00a">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>EcuMShutdownTargetReset</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:812918e0-5f3d-9111-6062-4fc555392f17">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>EcuMShutdownTargetSleep</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:68b39a3a-9e3c-40c0-8b2f-d30262687598">
                              <SHORT-NAME>EcuMDefaultResetModeRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">If EcuMDefaultShutdownTarget is EcuMShutdownTargetReset, this parameter selects the default reset mode. Otherwise this parameter may be ignored.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EcuMDefaultResetModeRef 配置项用于指定ECU管理模块在系统复位时默认采用的复位模式。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保该配置项引用的复位模式在EcuM模块中已定义且有效；复位模式的选择应符合系统的安全和恢复需求；在多模式系统中，正确管理不同模式下的转换和行为。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuM_00205</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuM/EcuMConfiguration/EcuMFlexConfiguration/EcuMResetMode</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:7cf854cf-a9cb-4ead-8eae-96bd1592bd0a">
                              <SHORT-NAME>EcuMDefaultSleepModeRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">If EcuMDefaultShutdownTarget is EcuMShutdownTargetSleep, this parameter selects the default sleep mode. Otherwise this parameter may be ignored.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EcuMDefaultSleepModeRef配置项用于指定ECU管理模块（EcuM）默认的睡眠模式，这是系统在没有活动或操作时应进入的低功耗状态。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保选择的默认睡眠模式与系统的能耗要求和唤醒源兼容；在系统设计阶段就确定并配置好此项，以避免运行时能耗过高；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对睡眠模式的定义和管理有明确规范，需要遵循这些规范以确保系统的可靠性和效率。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuM_00106</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuM/EcuMConfiguration/EcuMCommonConfiguration/EcuMSleepMode</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:e108fe98-dc5c-4f3c-9d9e-5a4989fb20d0">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EcuMDriverInitListOne</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Container for Init Block I.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EcuMDriverInitListOne 是用于定义在ECU管理模块初始化阶段一中需要调用的驱动初始化列表。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保所有列出的驱动与硬件和系统需求兼容；初始化顺序应根据系统依赖性和优先级合理安排；遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，确保驱动初始化的正确性和顺序。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This container holds a list of modules to be initialized. Each module in the list will be called for initialization in the list order.

                                                All modules in this list are initialized before the OS is started and so these modules require no OS support.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuM_00111</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b37908f7-5536-96bf-545e-fa7e8d6d11e0">
                              <SHORT-NAME>EcuMDriverInitItem</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">These containers describe the entries in a driver init list.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuM_00110</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <REQUIRES-INDEX>true</REQUIRES-INDEX>
                              <PARAMETERS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a50143a0-bea2-df92-120c-54c216ca74f6">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>EcuMModuleParameter</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">Definition of the function prototype and the parameter passed to the function.</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuM_00224</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
