                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:320a0bfb-905f-484f-89cb-c8938c1921b4">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EcuMDriverInitListZero</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Container for Init Block 0.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EcuMDriverInitListZero 是一个配置项，用于定义在操作系统启动阶段，即启动列表0（Start List Zero）中，需要初始化的驱动模块的顺序。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置EcuMDriverInitListZero时，需要确保列出的驱动初始化顺序与硬件和系统启动要求相匹配；此外，应注意不要在此列表中重复初始化同一驱动，以避免潜在的初始化冲突；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，确保所有必要的驱动在系统启动时得到正确的初始化。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">This container holds a list of modules to be initialized. Each module in the list will be called for initialization in the list order.

                                                All modules in this list are initialized before the post-build configuration has been loaded and the OS is initialized. Therefore, these modules may not use post-build configuration.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EcuM_00114</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
